# Shell scripts must keep LF line endings regardless of local core.autocrlf
# settings — deployment/docker-entrypoint.sh is invoked directly by /bin/sh
# inside a Linux container; CRLF line endings break `set -eu` parsing
# ("Illegal option -") and block application startup entirely on a Windows
# checkout with core.autocrlf=true. Found and fixed during POC/MVP runtime
# validation.
*.sh text eol=lf
